stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Requested: policy / trust / grant / binding / steering change
  Requested --> IdleCommit: owner idle (quiescence checked)
  IdleCommit --> Committed
  Requested --> Fenced: active work - fence admission
  Fenced --> IntentCaptured: capture unapplied intent
  IntentCaptured --> Paused: pause canonical tasks
  Paused --> Drained: drain native + retained work (Job Object members = 0)
  Drained --> Committed: revision-checked command commit
  Drained --> PausedUnapplied: invalid domain command
  Committed --> [*]
  PausedUnapplied --> [*]
